---
import PageHeading from "../components/page-heading.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/main.astro";
---

<Layout title="About - Bangla Web Fonts">
  <section class="relative z-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto my-12 px-7 lg:px-0">
    <PageHeading
      title="About"
      description="Bangla Web Fonts is a web font CDN that provides high-quality Bangla fonts for websites. Instead of downloading and hosting fonts manually, developers can integrate them via a simple CDN link, ensuring faster loading and smooth typography."
    />


        

        <!-- Features -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Features</h2>
            <ul class="mt-4 list-disc list-inside text-base leading-6 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:mt-4 lg:mt-6 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg">
                <li><strong>Fast CDN Delivery:</strong> Optimized for speed and performance.</li>
                <li><strong>Easy Integration:</strong> Just include a CSS link to use fonts.</li>
                <li><strong>No Extra Hosting Needed:</strong> Fonts are served directly from our CDN.</li>
                <li><strong>Supports Multiple Styles:</strong> Regular, Bold, and more.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Performance -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Cloudflare-Powered Performance</h2>
<img src="/assets/images/CloudflareNetwork.png" alt="Cloudflare Network" class="w-full">
            <ul class="mt-4 list-disc list-inside text-base leading-6 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:mt-4 lg:mt-6 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg">
                <li><strong>Cloudflare CDN:</strong> Fonts are hosted on Cloudflare’s global network.</li>
                <li><strong>Near-instant Loading:</strong> Cached fonts load quickly from the nearest server.</li>
                <li><strong>Worldwide Edge Locations:</strong> Cloudflare has over 300 data centers worldwide.</li>
                <li><strong>Optimized for PageSpeed:</strong> Fonts use modern formats like WOFF2.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- How It Works -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">How to use Bangla Web Fonts?</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-6 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:mt-4 lg:mt-6 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg">
                Using Bangla Web Fonts is simple. Add the CSS file of your chosen font to your website’s stylesheet.
            </p>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-dashed border-gray-300 text-sm overflow-auto mt-4">
                <pre class="">
/* Example: Using Solaiman Lipi Font */
@import url('https://banglawebfonts.pages.dev/css/solaiman-lipi.css');

body &#123;
  font-family: 'Solaiman Lipi', serif;
&#125;
</pre>


            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-6 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:mt-4 lg:mt-6 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg">
                For more details, visit <a href="/documentation/" class="text-blue-600 font-medium hover:underline">documentation</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Stack -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Built With</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mt-6">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <img src="/assets/images/AstroLogo.svg" alt="Astro" class="h-12">
                    <span class="mt-2">Astro</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <img src="/assets/images/TailwindLogo.svg" alt="Tailwind CSS" class="h-12">
                    <span class="mt-2">Tailwind CSS</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <img src="/assets/images/CloudflareLogo.png" alt="Cloudflare" class="h-12">
                    <span class="mt-2">Cloudflare</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <img src="/assets/images/GithubLogo.png" alt="GitHub" class="h-12">
                    <span class="mt-2">GitHub</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

<!-- Free subdomain -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Using a Free Subdomain</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-6 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:mt-4 lg:mt-6 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg">
                This site uses a free <span class="font-mono">.pages.dev</span> subdomain from <b>Cloudflare</b>. This ensures the site is <b>always free</b>. Since we use a free subdomain, there’s no need to renew a custom domain every year, so the CDN links will never break and everyone can always use the fonts safely and easily. Additionally, Cloudflare Pages provides <b>unlimited bandwidth</b>.
            </p>
        </div>

<!-- Fonts Copyright & License -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Fonts Copyright & License</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-6 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:mt-4 lg:mt-6 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg">
                All fonts available on Bangla Web Fonts are <b>copyrighted to their respective owners</b>. 
                Users must follow each font’s specific licensing terms before using them on websites or applications.
            </p>
        </div>


        <!-- wrbsite License -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Website Content License</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-6 text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200 sm:mt-4 lg:mt-6 sm:leading-7 lg:leading-8 sm:text-base lg:text-lg">

The website content (text, code, logo etc.) is licensed under the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/" target=_blank" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline"> Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).</a>

                <span class="italic mt-1 block">Note: Fonts, icons, third-party open-source or other licensed code/APIs used on this site are not covered by this site license and remain under their respective owners’ licenses, with proper credit given where applicable.</span>

</p>
        </div>


        <!-- Maintainer Info -->
        <div class="mt-10">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold leading-10 tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Maintainer & Contributors</h2>
            <div class="mt-4 p-6 rounded-xl border">
                <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Fuad Hasan Shihab</p>
<small>Maintainer</small>
                <div class="mt-3 flex gap-3">
                    <a href="mailto:contact.shihab1246@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Email</a> • 
                    <a href="https://github.com/fuadhasanshihab" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Github</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        
  </section>
</Layout>
